type: software
title: "JTS-MM: An open-source multimodal jaw tracking measurement system"
abstract: >-
  Hardware, firmware, recording software, and analysis code of JTS-MM, a low-cost system
  that records six-degree-of-freedom jaw kinematics, surface electromyography of the
  masticatory muscles, and inertial signals on one hardware clock.
